{"word":"ὅπλον","uri":"hoplon","senses":[{"word":"ὅπλον","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ὅπλον,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ου</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">τὸ</span>) <span class=\"ital\">propr.</span>\ninstrument, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nplur.</span> outillage, appareil, <span class=\"ital\">particul. :</span>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">t.\nmilit.</span> arme, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nplur.</span> les armes, <span class=\"ital\">en gén.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span> l’armement, l’armure :\n<span class=\"grec\">ὅπλοισιν ἐνὶ δεινοῖσιν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 254</span> (ils se\nrevêtirent) de leur terrible armure ; <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">N.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">10, 26 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pers.</span> <span class=\"refch\">457,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> arme offensive, <span class=\"ital\">au\nsg.</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de flèches,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.f.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">161,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou de toute arme offensive,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">474</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">au plur.</span> les\narmes : <span class=\"grec\">παραγγέλλειν εἰς τὰ ὅπλα,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 5, 13 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">κελεύειν ἐπὶ τὰ ὅπλα,</span> <span class=\"au