">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> les cordages, <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 2, 430 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thcr.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Idyl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">13, 52 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">A. Rh.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 726,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">au sg.</span> un cordage, <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">14, 346 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">21, 390,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> câble, amarre,\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 25,\n36 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">9, 115</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">III</span> outil d’artisan,\n<span class=\"ital\">dans Hom. touj. en parl. des outils du\nforgeron,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">18, 409, 412 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 433 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de même en\nparl. de la faucille du moissonneur,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 95</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">IV</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\ngén.</span> tout instrument, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. du bâton\nd’un vieillard,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Call.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ep.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 7 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">d’un plat,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 248 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">du membre\nviril,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Nic.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">683</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>), <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἕπω</span>.</div>\n"}]}